/- File: SessionMultiLib/Derivatives.lean

  The session half of the derivatives.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.Derivatives' dependencies (degree.ml's `DegreeDeps` and the
  extra theorems from Session, SessionLibrary and SessionMultiLib), and
  exports every theorem by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/derivatives.ml"`: its own `needs` (degree.ml) is the
  import of SessionMultiLib.Degree, and each bundle is built by `initialize`
  when the module is loaded, in file order.
-/

